VCP's recorded patches raise the codex-chatgpt crate recursion limit and register
selected Munarium libraries in the shared workspace and lockfile. Further changes
register the local CPU embedding adapter and its reviewed dependencies, followed
by the original local-corpus qualification executable and its retained governance
dependencies. The continuation-admission patch adapts the retained controller,
extension API and turn-input tests to support host denial of delegated starts.
The scoped-lifecycle patch adds controller thread identity, owned retained
interruption and the original lifecycle host workspace/lock entry. Modified
files carry modification notices. See the ordered patch record
under src/third_party/patches/codex/ and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

